<title>USA: Olympic Financial names president.</title>
<headline>Olympic Financial names president.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Olympic Financial Ltd said Monday that Richard Greenawalt was named its president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Greenawalt had been president, chief operating officer and a director of Advanta Corp, an $18 billion financial services company.</p>
<p>Greenawalt succeeds Warren Kanter who was elected chairman of the board. Kanter had been serving the company as chairman of the executive committee and acting chief executive officer since the resignation of Jeffrey Mack on August 26, 1996.</p>
<p>Olympic Financial is a consumer finance company which purchases, sells and services prime retail installment contracts for new and used automobiles.</p>
<p>		((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
